  "knownDifferences": [
    "GeoMoose 3.15.2 fixes ImageWMS at WMS 1.1.1 and sends SRS. OpenGeo keeps WMS 1.3.0 canonical but now negotiates and serializes a bounded WMS 1.1.1 compatibility representation.",
    "GeoMoose copies its browser-only cross-origin=anonymous option into the KVP request. OpenGeo accepts only that exact non-credentialed legacy hint and ignores it; every other hyphenated parameter remains invalid.",
